        684,
        1108
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0018_seg_005"
    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "The status register (SR),contains the interrupt mask (eight levels available) and the following condition codes: overflow (V), zero (Z), negative (N), carry (C), and extend (X). Additional status bits indicate that the processor is in the trace (T) mode and/or in the supervisor (S) state (see Figure 2-4). Bits 5, 6, 7, 11, 12, and 14 are undefined and reserved for future expansion",
      "bbox": [
        194,
        1134,
        1796,
        1362
      ],
